---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
---
<Base
  title="Pricing — WhisperFlow"
  description="WhisperFlow is free forever, unlimited, Apache-2.0. Not selling cloud yet — design the plan YOU would pay for and tell us."
>
  <script is:inline>
    function calc() {
      const words = +document.getElementById("words").value;
      const feats = [...document.querySelectorAll("input[name=feat]:checked")].length;
      const base = 0;
      const perFeat = 1.5;
      const unlimitedBoost = words > 90 ? 3 : 0;
      const total = Math.max(0, base + feats * perFeat + unlimitedBoost);
      document.getElementById("price").textContent = "$" + total;
      document.getElementById("wordsLabel").textContent =
        words <= 10 ? "5k words/mo" : words <= 40 ? "50k" : words <= 75 ? "250k" : words <= 90 ? "1M" : "Unlimited";
    }
    function mailtoPlan() {
      const words = document.getElementById("wordsLabel").textContent;
      const feats = [...document.querySelectorAll("input[name=feat]:checked")].map((f) => f.value).join(", ") || "none";
      const price = document.getElementById("price").textContent;
      const body = encodeURIComponent(
        `My ideal WhisperFlow plan:\n- Words: ${words}\n- Features: ${feats}\n- I would pay: ${price}/mo\n- (Optional) what would make it a no-brainer:\n`,
      );
      window.location.href = `mailto:whisperflow@naman.is-a.dev?subject=${encodeURIComponent("My ideal WhisperFlow plan")}&body=${body}`;
      document.getElementById("thanks").classList.remove("hidden");
    }
    document.addEventListener("change", calc);
    document.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", calc);
  </script>

  <section class="border-b border-rule">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 pb-24 pt-28 text-center sm:px-8 sm:pt-36">
      <p class="eyebrow justify-center">open-core, honestly</p>
      <h1 class="font-serif mx-auto mt-6 max-w-3xl text-6xl font-normal leading-[0.98] text-ink sm:text-8xl">
        free forever<span class="text-accent">.</span><br />no card. no caps.
      </h1>
      <p class="mx-auto mt-7 max-w-xl text-[16px] leading-7 text-ink-2">
        whisperflow runs entirely on your machine with your models — there is no meter
        to read and no bill to send. we might build hosted inference someday, for weak
        hardware. we honestly haven't decided. <span class="font-medium text-ink">you tell us.</span>
      </p>
      <div class="mt-10 flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4">
        <a href="/whisperflow/download/" class="btn-ink">download — $0</a>
        <a href="/whisperflow/sponsors/" class="btn-quiet">fund development ↗</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- the ledger: what zero dollars buys, printed plainly -->
  <section class="border-b border-rule bg-tint">
    <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 py-20 sm:px-8">
      <div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-3">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">unlimited dictation</p>
          <p class="font-serif mt-3 text-3xl font-normal text-ink">∞ words</p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-[14px] leading-6 text-ink-2">
            no weekly cap, no monthly cap, no trial timer. dictation is not a tier —
            it's the product.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">every feature</p>
          <p class="font-serif mt-3 text-3xl font-normal text-ink">all of it</p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-[14px] leading-6 text-ink-2">
            polish, dictionary, history, model manager — the same build for everyone.
            sponsors fund the runway, never a paywall.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">the fine print</p>
          <p class="font-serif mt-3 text-3xl font-normal text-ink">this page</p>
          <p class="mt-3 text-[14px] leading-6 text-ink-2">
            the only thing that costs anything here is the ink. if anyone charges you
            for whisperflow, you're being scammed.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- the calibrator: quiet, below the fold -->
  <section class="mx-auto max-w-3xl px-5 py-20 sm:px-8">
    <p class="eyebrow">help us decide</p>
    <h2 class="font-serif mt-4 text-4xl font-normal leading-[1.05] text-ink sm:text-5xl">
      design the plan <span class="text-accent">you'd</span> pay for.
    </h2>
    <p class="mt-5 max-w-md text-[14.5px] leading-7 text-ink-2">
      if we ever build hosted inference, what should it look like? drag, tick, and see
      what it's worth to you. zero obligation — this just opens an email. no tracking,
      no accounts, no storage.
    </p>

    <div class="proof-card mt-10">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-rule px-6 py-3.5">
        <span class="font-mono text-[11px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-2">plan calibrator</span>
        <span class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-ink-faint">zero tracking · just an email</span>
      </div>
      <div class="p-7 sm:p-9">
        <p class="font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ink-faint">words per month</p>
        <input id="words" type="range" min="0" max="100" value="100" class="mt-3 w-full accent-[#0E7A55]" aria-label="Words per month" />
        <p class="mt-1 text-[14px] text-ink-2"><span id="wordsLabel" class="font-mono font-medium text-ink">Unlimited</span></p>

        <p class="mt-7 font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-[0.16em] text-ink-faint">features</p>
        <div class="mt-3 grid gap-2 sm:grid-cols-2">
          {[
            ["cloud-relay", "hosted models relay (no local setup)"],
            ["sync", "cross-device history sync"],
            ["team", "team dictionary & snippets sharing"],
            ["priority", "priority support"],
          ].map(([id, label]) => (
            <label class="flex cursor-pointer items-center gap-3 border border-rule bg-paper px-4 py-3 text-[14px] text-ink-2 transition-colors hover:border-accent/60">
              <input type="checkbox" name="feat" value={id} class="h-4 w-4 accent-[#0E7A55]" />
              {label}
            </label>
          ))}
        </div>

        <div class="mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center justify-between gap-4 border-t border-rule pt-6">
          <p class="font-serif text-4xl"><span id="price" class="font-mono">$0</span><span class="text-base text-ink-2">/mo</span></p>
          <button type="button" onclick="mailtoPlan()" class="btn-ink">send us this plan</button>
        </div>
        <p id="thanks" class="mt-3 hidden font-mono text-[13px] text-accent">[ok] your email app just opened — hit send and we'll read it.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="mt-10 grid gap-8 sm:grid-cols-2">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">why free works</p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-[14px] leading-6 text-ink-2">
          models run on your machine; free api tiers (groq, gemini, openrouter…) cover byo
          polish for almost everyone. there's no server bill to pass on — so there's no price.
        </p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">bring your own key</p>
        <p class="mt-3 text-[14px] leading-6 text-ink-2">
          any openai-compatible endpoint plugs into settings → style. your key stays in your
          local config. the local-only lock overrides everything when you want pure offline.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-5 pb-24 text-center sm:px-8">
    <h2 class="font-serif text-4xl font-normal leading-[1.02] text-ink sm:text-5xl">
      meanwhile, it's <span class="text-accent">yours</span>.
    </h2>
    <div class="mt-8"><a href="/whisperflow/download/" class="btn-ink">download whisperflow</a></div>
  </section>
</Base>
